      "id": "Riverside.Win32",
      "range": "*"
    },
    "message": "\"Riverside.Tooling.CsWin32\" has a critical bug that breaks functionality when consuming CubeKit packages in projects that also use CsWin32.\nPlease use the \"Riverside.Win32\" package instead as it offers stable P/Invoke code that does not break compatibility with CsWin32 being used alongside it.",
    "reasons": [
      "CriticalBugs"
    ]
  },
